  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Seeing a stack of unsold cassette tapes, our protagonist's salesman instincts suddenly wake up. He marches into a specialty shop, charms the owner into buying twenty tapes for sixty thousand yen cash, and proposes an ambitious partnership on the street outside. Listen to him work his magic.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺がこれを売るよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そう簡単に売れないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "owner",
      "t": "あんた、面白いね。買ってやるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとうございます。さすがオーナー様、お目が高い！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "売れた！一本三千円で六万円だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんた営業マンだったのかよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうだ。これ、一日何本ぐらい売れてるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ、多くて一日二本だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ他の店も行こう。一日の目標は六十本だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ちょっと待てよ。俺と組むってことか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "だめか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんた、この世界に入る覚悟はあるのか？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そう簡単に売れないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They will not sell that easily.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "owner",
      "t": "買ってやるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will buy them from you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "さすがオーナー様、お目が高い！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As expected of you, Owner, you have a keen eye!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "売れた！一本三千円で六万円だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They sold! At three thousand yen apiece, that is sixty thousand yen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんた営業マンだったのかよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, were you a salesman?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうだ。これ、一日何本ぐらい売れてるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Roughly how many of these sell per day?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ、多くて一日二本だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, two a day at most.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ他の店も行こう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It means 'Then let us hit other shops too.'.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一日の目標は六十本だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our daily target is sixty.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ちょっと待てよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on a second.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんた、この世界に入る覚悟はあるのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you really have the resolve to step into this world?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
